 * Ultimate Mandelbrot Set Renderer
 * ================================
 * Features:
 * 1. Multi-architecture: Scalar, SSE4, AVX2, AVX-512
 * 2. GPU offloading via OpenCL (optional)
 * 3. Automatic CPU feature detection
 * 4. Grayscale and color modes
 * 5. Configurable from command line
 * 6. Performance benchmarking
 * 7. TILE RENDERING + AUTO-STITCHING (new)
 * 
 * Build (AVX-512):
 *   gcc -O3 -march=native -mavx512f -mavx512bw -mavx512dq -mavx512vl -DUSE_OPENCL mandelbrot_tiles_final.c -o mandelbrot_tiles.exe -lm -lpng -fopenmp -lOpenCL
 * 
 * Build (AVX2):
 *   gcc -O3 -march=native -mavx2 -DUSE_OPENCL mandelbrot_tiles_final.c -o mandelbrot_tiles.exe -lm -lpng -fopenmp -lOpenCL
 * 
 * Usage:
 *   mandelbrot [options]
 *   mandelbrot --avx512 -w 40000 -h 20000 --tile-size 3840 -o huge.png
 */

